{"id":"salmo_n","lemma":"salmón","pos":"noun","rank":4506,"glosses":["salmon","salmon (color)"],"ipa":"/salˈmon/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"salmones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-salm%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"El pescado sabía a salmón.","en":"The fish tasted like salmon.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dead fish intended for…"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"El salmón pone sus huevos en agua dulce.","en":"Salmon lay their eggs in fresh water.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"guts, balls"},{"g":"in / on"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"fresh water"]]},{"text":"El resto de nosotros comimos salmón ahumado.","en":"The rest of us all had the smoked salmon.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"rest, remainder"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to eat","l":"comer"},null,{"g":"smoked"}]},{"text":"El salmón va río arriba y pone sus huevos en la arena.","en":"Salmon go up the river and lay their eggs in the sand.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606617","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"okay"},null,null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},{"g":"guts, balls"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"sand, gravel"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"upstream"]]},{"text":"El único pescado que le gusta comer a Tom es el salmón.","en":"The only fish Tom likes to eat is salmon.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"dead fish intended for…"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to eat"},{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}